   <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" style=\"fill:white; width:20px; height:20px; vertical-align:middle; margin-bottom:0;\"><path d=\"M.057 24l1.687-6.163c-1.041-1.804-1.588-3.849-1.588-5.946 0-6.556 5.332-11.891 11.891-11.891 3.181 0 6.167 1.24 8.413 3.488 2.245 2.248 3.481 5.236 3.481 8.403 0 6.556-5.332 11.89-11.891 11.89-2.015 0-3.991-.511-5.741-1.486l-6.252 1.705zm6.411-3.951c1.547.919 3.033 1.378 4.416 1.378 5.485 0 9.95-4.466 9.95-9.95 0-2.659-1.036-5.158-2.915-7.04-1.879-1.88-4.382-2.916-7.035-2.916-5.485 0-9.951 4.466-9.951 9.95 0 2.016.511 3.991 1.486 5.741l-.143.243-1.012 3.693 3.793-1.011.232-.143zm11.264-7.443c-.328-.164-1.942-.958-2.242-1.069-.3-.11-.519-.164-.738.164-.219.328-.848 1.069-1.039 1.288-.192.219-.383.246-.711.082s-1.388-.512-2.644-1.631c-.977-.872-1.637-1.948-1.828-2.276-.192-.328-.021-.506.143-.669.148-.147.328-.383.492-.575.164-.192.219-.328.328-.548.11-.219.055-.411-.027-.575s-.738-1.78-.985-2.383c-.247-.604-.492-.519-.684-.519h-.575c-.219 0-.575.082-.876.411s-1.15 1.123-1.15 2.738 1.178 3.177 1.342 3.396c.164.219 2.318 3.538 5.614 4.96.784.338 1.396.539 1.873.69.789.251 1.507.215 2.073.13.632-.094 1.942-.794 2.215-1.56.274-.767.274-1.424.192-1.56-.083-.137-.301-.219-.629-.383z\"/></svg>\n            Chat for Surat AC Service\n        </a>\n    </div>\n\n    <section id=\"disclaimer\">\n        <div class=\"disclaimer-box\">\n            <h3>Service Disclaimer for Surat &#038; South Gujarat</h3>\n            <p><strong>Atlas Aircon</strong> operates as an <strong>independent and unauthorised service provider</strong> serving the entire Surat district. We are not affiliated with the official voltas brand network. Our expertise lies in repairing <strong>out-of-warranty</strong> cooling systems for the textile, diamond, and industrial sectors, as well as residential homes. Official warranty claims should be directed to authorized centers. Our services come with our own <strong>Atlas Service Guarantee</strong> on workmanship and spares.</p>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"introduction\">\n        <div class=\"section-header\">\n            <h2>The Leading <span class=\"focus-keyword\">voltas ac service center Surat</span></h2>\n        </div>\n        <p>Surat, famed as the Silk City and Diamond City of India, faces specific cooling challenges due to high humidity levels and the industrial density of textile looms and diamond polishing units. The presence of lint dust in textile markets like Ring Road and industrial heat in Pandesara GIDC requires specialized maintenance protocols. As a specialized <span class=\"focus-keyword\">voltas ac service center Surat</span>, Atlas Aircon delivers tailored solutions for these unique environments.</p>\n\n        <p>We provide rapid support to the commercial hubs of Adajan and Vesu, ensuring that corporate offices and showrooms remain comfortable. Our industrial teams are experts in handling heavy-duty <strong>panel ACs</strong> in diamond factories in Katargam and Varachha, where precision temperature control is critical. Whether you need an urgent <strong>split AC repair in Piplod</strong> or comprehensive <strong>chiller maintenance in Sachin GIDC</strong>, Atlas Aircon offers independent, prompt, and reliable service. We ensure your businesses thrive and your homes stay cool in Surat&#8217;s coastal climate.</p>\n\n        <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: 40px 0;\">\n            <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/ac-repair-in-vadodara.webp\" alt=\"voltas ac service center Surat textile cooling\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\" title=\"\">\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"pros-cons\">\n        <div class=\"section-header\">\n            <h2>Why Surat Chooses Us?</h2>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"pros-cons-container\">\n            <div class=\"pros-list\">\n                <h3>7 Key Advantages (Pros)</h3>\n                <ul class=\"list-style-none\">\n                    <li><strong>Textile Expertise:</strong> Specialized cleaning for lint-clogged ACs in textile markets and factories.</li>\n                    <li><strong>City-Wide Reach:</strong> Rapid response from Varachha to Vesu, covering all major zones.</li>\n                    <li><strong>Out-of-Warranty Specialists:</strong> Cost-effective repair for older units in industrial GIDCs.</li>\n                    <li><strong>Diamond Zone Focus:</strong> Precision cooling maintenance for Katargam and Mahidharpura diamond units.</li>\n                    <li><strong>Anti-Corrosion Care:</strong> Protection for units in coastal areas like Dumas and Bhimpore.</li>\n                    <li><strong>Shift Timing Support:</strong> Maintenance available during factory shift changes to minimize downtime.</li>\n                    <li><strong>Service Guarantee:</strong> 30-day labor and 90-day parts warranty on all Surat repairs.</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"cons-list\">\n                <h3>Service Limitations (Cons)</h3>\n                <ul class=\"list-style-none\">\n                    <li><strong>Unauthorised Center:</strong> We are not part of the official voltas service network.</li>\n                    <li><strong>Warranty Void:</strong> Repairs by us will void any remaining manufacturer warranty.</li>\n                    <li><strong>Paid Service:</strong> We do not accept free service coupons or AMC cards from the brand.</li>\n                    <li><strong>Brand Use:</strong> Brand names are used only to describe our repair capabilities.</li>\n                    <li><strong>Distance Charges:</strong> Travel fees apply for remote industrial units in Hazira/Olpad.</li>\n                    <li><strong>Part Lead Time:</strong> Specific inverter PCB components may take 2-3 days to source.</li>\n                    <li><strong>Visit Fee:</strong> An inspection charge applies if no repair is carried out.</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"repair-types\">\n        <div class=\"section-header\">\n            <h2>Cooling Services for Surat&#8217;s Needs</h2>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"grid-3\">\n            <div class=\"card\">\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M21 16.5c0 .38-.21.71-.53.88l-7.97 4.19c-.32.17-.66.17-.98 0l-7.97-4.19c-.32-.17-.55-.5-.55-.88V7.5c0-.38.21-.71.53-.88l7.97-4.19c.32-.17.66-.17.98 0l7.97 4.19c.32.17.55.5.55.88v9z\"/></svg>\n                <h3>Residential AC Repair</h3>\n                <p>Fast service for Adajan, Pal, and City Light. We fix water leakage, PCB faults, and cooling issues in Split &#038; Window ACs.</p>\n                <a href=\"/split-ac-service-surat\" style=\"color: var(--blue); font-weight: bold; text-decoration: none;\">Home Services</a>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card\">\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 2L4.5 20.29l.71.71L12 18l6.79 3 .71-.71z\"/></svg>\n                <h3>Textile &#038; Diamond Cooling</h3>\n                <p>Maintenance of <strong>Panel ACs</strong> and <strong>Package Units</strong> for textile mills in Pandesara and diamond offices in Varachha.</p>\n                <a href=\"/panel-ac-service-surat\" style=\"color: var(--blue); font-weight: bold; text-decoration: none;\">Industrial Support</a>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card\">\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M19.35 10.04C18.67 6.59 15.64 4 12 4 9.11 4 6.6 5.64 5.35 8.04 2.34 8.36 0 10.91 0 14c0 3.31 2.69 6 6 6h13c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5 0-2.64-2.05-4.78-4.65-4.96z\"/></svg>\n                <h3>Commercial Refrigeration</h3>\n                <p>Repair of <strong>Water Coolers</strong> and <strong>Deep Freezers</strong> for Surat&#8217;s food courts, colleges, and diamond bourses.</p>\n                <a href=\"/water-cooler-repair-services-surat\" style=\"color: var(--blue); font-weight: bold; text-decoration: none;\">Chilling Services</a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"internal-links\">\n        <div class=\"section-header\">\n            <h2>Specialized Repair Solutions</h2>\n        </div>\n        <p>Our Surat technicians are trained to handle diverse equipment:</p>\n        <div class=\"grid-3\">\n            <div class=\"card\">\n                <a href=\"/air-cooler-repair-services-surat\" style=\"text-decoration:none; color:inherit;\">\n                    <h4>Air Cooler Service</h4>\n                    <p>Pump replacement and motor repair for industrial coolers in textile dyeing units.</p>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card\">\n                <a href=\"/chiller-repair-services-surat\" style=\"text-decoration:none; color:inherit;\">\n                    <h4>Industrial Chillers</h4>\n                    <p>Maintenance of process chillers used in textile printing and chemical industries.</p>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card\">\n                <a href=\"/cold-room-repair-services-surat\" style=\"text-decoration:none; color:inherit;\">\n                    <h4>Cold Storage Repair</h4>\n                    <p>Emergency repair for cold storages in APMC market and food processing zones.</p>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card\">\n                <a href=\"/deep-freezer-repair-services-surat\" style=\"text-decoration:none; color:inherit;\">\n                    <h4>Deep Freezer Repair</h4>\n                    <p>Gas charging and thermostat replacement for ice cream parlors and frozen food outlets.</p>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card\">\n                <a href=\"/refrigerator-repair-services-surat\" style=\"text-decoration:none; color:inherit;\">\n                    <h4>Refrigerator Repair</h4>\n                    <p>Double door and side-by-side fridge repair for high-rise apartments in Vesu.</p>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card\">\n                <a href=\"/hvac-repair-services-surat\" style=\"text-decoration:none; color:inherit;\">\n                    <h4>HVAC Projects</h4>\n                    <p>Ducting installation and repair for textile markets and corporate houses.</p>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"price-table\">\n        <div class=\"section-header\">\n            <h2>AC Service Price List &#8211; Surat (Out-of-Warranty)</h2>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"table-container\">\n            <table>\n                <thead>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th>Service Description</th>\n                        <th>Avg. Price (Surat)</th>\n                        <th>Guarantee</th>\n                        <th>Action</th>\n                    </tr>\n                </thead>\n                <tbody>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>Split AC Wet Service (Jet Pump)</td>\n                        <td>₹599</td>\n                        <td>30 Days</td>\n                        <td><a href=\"/contact-us\">Book Now</a></td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>Split AC Gas Charging (R32/R410)</td>\n                        <td>₹2500+</td>\n                        <td>90 Days</td>\n                        <td><a href=\"/shop\">Details</a></td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>Window AC Installation</td>\n                        <td>₹800</td>\n                        <td>6 Months</td>\n                        <td><a href=\"/ac-installation-surat\">Book</a></td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>Textile Mill AMC (Bulk)</td>\n                        <td>On Quote</td>\n                        <td>Service Contract</td>\n                        <td><a href=\"/panel-ac-service-surat\">Inquire</a></td>\n                    </tr>\n                </tbody>\n            </table>\n        </div>\n        <p><em>* Prices are indicative for independent services in Surat. Industrial zones (Sachin/Pandesara) may attract transport charges.</em></p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"surat-areas\">\n        <div class=\"section-header\">\n            <h2>Areas Served in Surat City</h2>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"areas-list\">\n            Adajan | Varachha | Katargam | Vesu | Piplod | Dumas Road | City Light | Bhatar | Udhna | Pandesara | Limbayat | Dindoli | Amroli | Kosad | Pal | Rander | Jahangirpura | Athwa Lines | Ghod Dod Road | Parle Point | Nanpura | Ring Road | Majura Gate | Althan | Bamroli | Magdalla | Bhimpore | Olpad | Hazira.\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"industrial-zones\">\n        <div class=\"section-header\">\n            <h2>Industrial Clusters Served (GIDC)</h2>\n        </div>\n        <p>We provide priority support to these critical manufacturing zones:</p>\n        <div class=\"areas-list\">\n            Sachin GIDC | Pandesara GIDC | Katargam Diamond Zone | Udhna Udyog Nagar | Hazira Industrial Area | Ichhapore GIDC | Bhatpore GIDC | Pipodara GIDC | Kim GIDC | Kosamba | Diamond Bourse Area | Textile Market Ring Road.\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"faq\">\n        <div class=\"section-header\">\n            <h2>Surat AC Service FAQs</h2>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"faq-container\">\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <div class=\"faq-question\">1. Are you the authorized voltas service center for Surat?</div>\n                <div class=\"faq-answer\">No, we are a leading independent and unauthorised service provider. We specialize in out-of-warranty repairs for Surat&#8217;s industries and homes.</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <div class=\"faq-question\">2. Do you provide service in Sachin GIDC?</div>\n                <div class=\"faq-answer\">Yes, we have dedicated teams for Sachin and Pandesara GIDC, specializing in maintaining cooling units in textile mills.</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <div class=\"faq-question\">3. Can you remove lint dust from my AC?</div>\n                <div class=\"faq-answer\">Yes, we use specialized pressure jet pumps to thoroughly clean lint and fiber dust that commonly clogs ACs in Surat&#8217;s textile areas.</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <div class=\"faq-question\">4. How quickly can you reach Vesu?</div>\n                <div class=\"faq-answer\">For residential areas like Vesu, Adajan, and Piplod, we typically offer same-day service turnaround.</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <div class=\"faq-question\">5. Do you offer AMC for diamond offices?</div>\n                <div class=\"faq-answer\">Yes, we offer specialized AMCs for diamond offices in Varachha and Katargam, ensuring dust-free precision cooling.</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <div class=\"faq-question\">6. Is on-site gas charging available in Katargam?</div>\n                <div class=\"faq-answer\">Yes, our mobile vans carry all refrigerants (R32, R410A, R22) to perform on-site charging at your factory or home.</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <div class=\"faq-question\">7. Can you fix water coolers in textile markets?</div>\n                <div class=\"faq-answer\">Absolutely. We repair commercial water coolers for large textile markets on Ring Road.</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <div class=\"faq-question\">8. What is the guarantee on PCB repair?</div>\n                <div class=\"faq-answer\">We provide a 3-month warranty on component-level PCB repairs, ensuring reliable operation despite power fluctuations.</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <div class=\"faq-question\">9. Do you work on Sundays in Surat?</div>\n                <div class=\"faq-answer\">Yes, we offer emergency services on Sundays, especially for industrial clients and busy residential areas.</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <div class=\"faq-question\">10. How do I book a technician?</div>\n                <div class=\"faq-answer\">Click the WhatsApp button or call +91 97272 57141 to schedule a visit from our Surat-based expert team.</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <footer>\n        <div class=\"footer-links\">\n            <a href=\"/home\">Home</a> | <a href=\"/shop\">Shop</a> | <a href=\"/ac-service-surat\">surat</a> | <a href=\"/contact-us\">Contact Surat Support</a>\n        </div>\n        <p>&copy; 2026 Atlas Aircon &#8211; Independent <span class=\"focus-keyword\">voltas ac service center Surat</span>. The Trusted Choice for Diamond &#038; Textile City Cooling.</p>\n        <p>Location: Serving Surat, Adajan, Varachha, Vesu &#038; GIDC Areas | Phone: +91 97272 57141 | Email: atlasaircon1@gmail.com</p>\n    </footer>\n\n    <script>\n        // Simple FAQ toggle\n        document.querySelectorAll('.faq-question').forEach(item => {\n            item.addEventListener('click', () => {\n                const answer = item.nextElementSibling;\n                if (answer.style.display === 'block') {\n                    answer.style.display = 'none';\n                } else {\n                    answer.style.display = 'block';\n                }\n            });\n        });\n    </script>\n\n</div>",
